  "id": "symbolic",
  "term": "Symbolic",
  "definition": "Symbolic refers to cues or objects that carry socially or culturally shared meaning beyond their basic visual form. In this packet, it describes icons such as national symbols that are meaningful within a culture and are processed differently from neutral objects.",
